<title>USA: Sioux Falls feeder cattle off $1-$2 - USDA.</title>
<headline>Sioux Falls feeder cattle off $1-$2 - USDA.</headline>
<dateline>SIOUX FALLS 1997-04-29</dateline>
<text>
<p>Feeder steers and heifers sold $1.00-$2.00 per cwt lower, compared to last Thursday, USDA said. Demand moderate. 98 percent over 600 lbs.</p>
<p>Steers: Medium and Large 1: 650-700 lbs 77.50-79.50;</p>
<p>750-800 lbs 75.50-76.30; 800-850 lbs 69.75-73.50; Load 879 lbs 71.20; 900-1000 lbs 67.25-70.85; 1050-1100 lbs 65.00-66.00.</p>
<p>Heifers: Medium and Large 1: 700-750 lbs 68.25-70.75; Load 840 lbs 66.90; 900-1000 lbs 64.00-64.30.</p>
